      <div class="cav">Frame it, keep it private</div>
      <h1>Beautify a Screenshot <em>Without Uploading It</em></h1>
      <p class="dek">A screenshot often holds more than you mean to share: names, emails, balances, whole dashboards. Most beautifier tools ask you to upload it to their servers first, then watermark or paywall the result. Here is how to wrap a screenshot in a clean device frame entirely in your browser, so it never leaves your machine.</p>
