          <text x="20" y="122" font-family="Karla, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#5a7355">Best Answer Hub: 0 bytes uploaded</text>
          <rect x="20" y="132" width="120" height="42" rx="8" fill="#E4EADD" stroke="#cdd9c8"/><text x="80" y="157" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Karla, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#5a7355">your screenshot</text>
