      <ul class="sources">
        <li>MDN, <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Canvas_API" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Canvas API</a> and <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLCanvasElement/toDataURL" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">toDataURL</a> (in-browser image drawing and PNG export).</li>
